+### Shell Shims (Direct Commands)
+
+Codebuff supports shell shims for direct command invocation without the `codebuff` prefix.
+
+- **Cross-platform**: Works on Windows (CMD/PowerShell), macOS, and Linux (bash/zsh/fish)
